  "prefLabel": "Stra 1106.05 Reimbursement Procedures for Accelerated Programs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Stra 1106.05 Reimbursement Procedures for Accelerated Programs. Participating postsecondary institutions that offer an eligible program that takes less than a semester or an academic year shall seek full reimbursement consistent with Stra 1106.04.\n\nSource. #12550, eff 6-19-18",
